🚨 Troubleshooting
If you see ⚠️ icons:

Find the icon key being used
Add it to icon-map.ts in the ICON_MAP object
Reload the page

If icons don't show at all:

Check that icon-map.ts is in the correct location
Verify import paths in renderer files
Check browser console for import errors


